      "instance_name": "wheelchair_pushing",
      "label": "person pushing another in wheelchair",
      "description": "A person is pushing another person in a wheelchair. The person in the wheelchair is smiling and appears joyful, while the person pushing is standing behind them. The scene takes place outdoors on a paved path surrounded by greenery.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_683747f9"
